        "reason": "Reversed nodes insert non-torsion +2-spheres \u27f9 IMT BF adjunction kills standard BF invariants"
      },
      {
        "name": "Chern\u2013Weil neutrality \u22a5 entropy/Sambusetti",
        "branch": "all signs, all orbifold+ALE",
        "scope": "every orbifold + Ricci-flat ALE resolution",
        "reason": "Half-flat ALE: \u0394(\u03c7\u2212(3/2)|\u03c4|) = 0; BCG volume comparison: d\u00b7\u03c7(Y) \u2264 \u03c7_orb(O)"
      }
    ],
    "consequence": "A refutation of Yau-26 in dim 4 must either: (a) construct near-pinched metrics outside the orbifold+ALE class (non-warped neck/connector), or (b) discover a no-Einstein mechanism outside monopole, BF, and entropy certificates."
  }
